\]

\[
x = 3.16 \times 10^{-5}
\]

The change in concentration of [Fe(CN)₆]⁴⁻ is \(x/6\):

\[
\frac{x}{6} = \frac{3.16 \times 10^{-5}}{6} = 5.27 \times 10^{-6}
\]

