\[
\frac{1}{1 - x_i} = \frac{1}{1 - y_i} \sum_{j=1}^{n} \frac{1}{1 - y_j} \log \left( \frac{1}{x_j} \right)
\]

For the binary system of ethanol and water, the equation simplifies to:

\[
\frac{1}{1 - x_i} = \frac{1}{1 - y_i} \left( \frac{1}{1 - x_1} \log \left( \frac{1}{x_1} \right) + \frac{1}{1 - x_2} \log \left( \frac{1}{x_2} \right) \right)
\]

