   \mathbf{E}' = \mathbf{L} \mathbf{E}
   \]
   \[
   \mathbf{J}' = \mathbf{L} \mathbf{J}
   \]
   where \( \mathbf{L} \) is the orientation matrix (same as \( \mathbf{L}_{ij} \)).

