\[ T = \frac{1}{1 + \frac{1}{n^2} \cdot \frac{1 - \sin^2 \theta}{1 - \sin^2 \theta}} \]  
\[ T = \frac{1}{1 + \frac{1}{n^2} \frac{1 - \sin^2 \theta}{1 - \sin^2 \theta}} \]  
\[ T = \frac{1}{1 + \frac{1}{n^2}} \]  
\[ T = \frac{n^2}{n^2 + 1} \]  
\[ T = \frac{1.5^2}{1.5^2 + 1} = \frac{2.25}{2.25 + 1} = \frac{2.25}{3.25} = \frac{9}{13} \approx 0.6923 \]  
