\[ 360^\circ = 5 \beta + 3 \times 90^\circ \]  
\[ 360^\circ = 5 \beta + 270^\circ \]  
\[ 90^\circ = 5 \beta \]  
\[ \beta = 18^\circ \]  

(b) **Fraction of intensity for \( p \)-polarized light**  
