The given condition \(n_{\text{eff}} - n_f \approx 0.3\) is consistent with the case where \(n_{\text{eff}}\) is the effective refractive index of the waveguide and \(n_f\) is the refractive medium outside the waveguide. The decay length is related to the difference in refractive indices:

