\[
Q = P_f - P_i
\]

The square of the four-momentum transfer is:

\[
Q^2 = (P_f - P_i) \cdot (P_f - P_i) = (P_f - P_i)_0 (P_f - P_1)_0 - (P_f - P_i)_x^2 - (P_f - P_i)_y^2 - (P_f - P_i)_z^2
\]

